Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 14:59:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] [tests/gtest]: send parsed JSON test cases as messages
 to bgpd

Introduces the initial link-state message construction and transfer
logic to send to bgpd.

Signed-off-by: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
